h3. 4. Allure Reporting

* *Visibility*: Interactive reports for technical and non-technical stakeholders
* *Transparency*: Each test step visible with screenshots, logs, and execution details
* *Trend Analysis*: Historical data to identify flaky tests and patterns
* *Metrics*: Automated test counts, coverage reports, and success rates

